# UML class diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class Command {
        <<interface>>
        +execute()
        +undo()
        +getName() String
    }

    class CommandManager {
        -undoStack: Deque~Command~
        -redoStack: Deque~Command~
        +executeCommand(command)
        +undo()
        +redo()
    }

    class AddShapeCommand
    class DeleteShapeCommand
    class MoveShapeCommand
    class ChangeColorCommand

    Command <|.. AddShapeCommand
    Command <|.. DeleteShapeCommand
    Command <|.. MoveShapeCommand
    Command <|.. ChangeColorCommand
    CommandManager --> Command : stores

    class Drawing {
        -shapes: List~Shape~
        +add(shape)
        +remove(shape)
        +findTopShapeAt(point)
    }

    class Shape {
        <<abstract>>
        -color: Color
        -strokeWidth: float
        +draw(graphics)
        +contains(point) boolean
        +moveBy(dx, dy)
    }

    class LineShape
    class RectangleShape
    class EllipseShape

    Shape <|-- LineShape
    Shape <|-- RectangleShape
    Shape <|-- EllipseShape
    Drawing o-- Shape

    AddShapeCommand --> Drawing
    DeleteShapeCommand --> Drawing
    MoveShapeCommand --> Shape
    ChangeColorCommand --> Shape